# SoundPlant demo: jungle, 170 BPM, G minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A jungle song in G minor. A reese bass riff (G | G | Eb | F) and a ragga 'oh' chop on the offbeats ride a chopped break;
# the break is re-edited every four and eight bars, with four bars of steppers and a rewind in the first drop.
# T1 kit (sub kick, backbeat, rolling ghost hats)  T2 knit reese  T3 knit dusty pad  T4 voile 'oh' chop  T5 slice break (jungle)
# T6 voile whisper pad  T7 cane temple bell  T8 cane hand drum. Song: intro 16, drop 32, beatless break 24, drop 2 48, outro 16.
bpm 170
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 7
knob 9 e3 1

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a sub kick on the break's kick, the backbeat doubled, ghost hats rolling, toms and a clap for the steppers
knob 1 d1.k3 84
knob 1 d1.volume 84
knob 1 d2.volume 74
knob 1 d2.send2 28
knob 1 d3.volume 62
knob 1 d4.volume 62
knob 1 d5.volume 70
knob 1 d5.send2 36
knob 1 d6.volume 66
knob 1 d6.send2 24
knob 1 d7.volume 62
knob 1 d7.send2 24
knob 1 d8.volume 56
knob 1 d9.volume 56
knob 1 d9.send1 14
knob 1 level 74
# T2 the knit reese: three detuned saws, low-passed, its filter moved slowly by locks; mono
preset 2 reese knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 ctype drive
knob 2 camt 36
knob 2 ctone 90
knob 2 cmix 90
knob 2 level 100
knob 2 pan 64
# T3 a knit dusty pad: the chords Gm9, Ebmaj7, Fsus4, Dm7
preset 3 dusty_pad knit
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 e3 3
knob 3 r 64
knob 3 level 84
knob 3 pan 40
knob 3 send2 40
# T4 a voile choir singing 'oh': the ragga chop
preset 4 vocal_chop voile
knob 4 e1 2
knob 4 e2 96
knob 4 e3 34
knob 4 e4 30
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 104
knob 4 pan 88
knob 4 send1 56
knob 4 send2 30
# T5 the slice engine on its jungle break: sixteen slices, mono; notes 53..68 pick the slice
preset 5 jungle slice
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 96
knob 5 pan 64
knob 5 send2 12
# T6 a voile whisper pad: breath over the chords, its filter on slow locks
preset 6 whisper_pad voile
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 r 84
knob 6 level 76
knob 6 pan 18
knob 6 send2 56
# T7 a cane temple bell: the echoing melody of the break and the dub stabs of the drops
preset 7 temple_bell cane
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 90
knob 7 d 88
knob 7 r 72
knob 7 pan 108
knob 7 send1 64
knob 7 send2 36
# T8 a cane hand drum: the percussion line
preset 8 hand_drum cane
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 level 84
knob 8 pan 28
knob 8 send1 24
knob 8 send2 20
# FX I a dotted-eighth dub echo, FX II a dark hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 80
knob 11 e3 76
knob 11 e4 50
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 74
knob 12 e3 50
mst lo 64
mst hi 74
mst comp 58
mst pump 20
mst pumpby kick
mst release 66
mst level 104

