# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro A: the pad, the whisper and the bell, alone
scenedef 1 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 xx.xx..x..
# intro B: the ghost slices, the hats and the reese's low note come in
scenedef 2 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 ...x...x..
# intro C: the chop whisper and a drum
scenedef 3 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 ..........
# intro D: the snare roll and the build
scenedef 4 5 1 2 1 6 1 8 1 1 2
scenemute 4 .x.....x..
# drop A: the reese riff and the break, the sparse chop
scenedef 5 2 2 3 2 2 2 4 2 1 1
scenemute 5 ......xx..
# drop A, the ragga chop
scenedef 6 2 2 3 3 2 2 4 2 1 1
scenemute 6 ......x...
# drop B: the break re-edited, the bell stabs
scenedef 7 3 2 3 3 3 2 4 2 1 1
scenemute 7 ..........
# drop B with the answer, a stutter at the end
scenedef 8 3 2 3 4 3 2 4 2 1 3
scenemute 8 ..........
# steppers: a kick on every beat, the clap on three
scenedef 9 4 3 3 2 5 2 4 3 1 1
scenemute 9 ..........
# drop C: the reese riff B, the break re-cut
scenedef 10 3 4 3 3 4 2 4 2 1 1
scenemute 10 ..........
# drop C with the answer
scenedef 11 3 4 3 4 3 2 4 2 1 1
scenemute 11 ..........
# drop C ends in the rewind: repeat, echo, mute
scenedef 12 3 4 3 3 4 2 4 2 1 4
scenemute 12 ..........
# break A: the pad, the whisper and the echoing bell, no beat
scenedef 13 1 5 1 5 1 3 2 1 1 5
scenemute 13 xx.xx..x..
# break B: the sub drone and the chop's echo join
scenedef 14 1 5 1 5 1 3 3 1 1 5
scenemute 14 x...x..x..
# the build: the snare rolling up under the pad
scenedef 15 5 5 2 5 6 4 8 1 1 6
scenemute 15 .x.x...x..
# the build, then a withheld bar
scenedef 16 6 5 2 5 6 4 8 1 1 7
scenemute 16 .x.xx..x..
# drop 2 A: the reese riff and the break, bigger
scenedef 17 7 6 4 6 7 5 5 4 1 1
scenemute 17 ..........
# drop 2 B: the break re-cut
scenedef 18 7 6 4 7 8 5 5 4 1 1
scenemute 18 ..........
# drop 2 B with a stutter at the end
scenedef 19 7 6 4 7 8 5 5 4 1 3
scenemute 19 ..........
# steppers 2
scenedef 20 4 7 4 6 5 5 4 3 1 1
scenemute 20 ..........
# drop 2 C: the reese riff B
scenedef 21 7 8 4 6 8 5 5 4 1 1
scenemute 21 ..........
# drop 2 C with the answer
scenedef 22 7 8 4 7 7 5 5 4 1 1
scenemute 22 ..........
# drop 2 ends in a stutter
scenedef 23 7 8 4 7 7 5 5 4 1 8
scenemute 23 ..........
# drop 2 tag: the chop, the bell and the pads without the reese or the break
scenedef 24 7 8 4 6 1 5 5 4 1 1
scenemute 24 .x..x.....
# outro A: the pad, the whisper and the bell, a soft hat
scenedef 25 8 8 1 1 1 6 6 1 1 1
scenemute 25 .x.xx..x..
# outro B: the pad, the whisper and the bell
scenedef 26 8 8 3 1 1 7 6 1 1 1
scenemute 26 xx.xx..x..
# outro C: the last chord and one bell
scenedef 27 8 8 5 1 1 7 7 1 1 1
scenemute 27 xx.xx..x..
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:4 7:4 8:4 9:4 10:4 11:4 12:4 13:8 14:8 15:4 16:4 17:4 18:4 17:4 19:4 20:4 21:4 22:4 21:4 22:4 21:4 23:4 24:4 25:8 26:4 27:4
songloop 0
expect lanes <65

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_jungle.wav
tap PLAY
bars 136
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
